{
  "N01": {
    "id": "N01",
    "text": "早上七点半，桌上有三盒药，一张写了又划掉的单子。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N01.wav",
    "duration_s": 5.952
  },
  "N02": {
    "id": "N02",
    "text": "哪盒饭前，哪盒饭后，昨天到底吃没吃——",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N02.wav",
    "duration_s": 4.728
  },
  "N03": {
    "id": "N03",
    "text": "电话那头问一句『今天吃药了吗』，这头常常答不上来。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N03.wav",
    "duration_s": 5.208
  },
  "N04": {
    "id": "N04",
    "text": "不是不上心。是字太小，规矩太多，一天要记好几回。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N04.wav",
    "duration_s": 6.528
  },
  "N05": {
    "id": "N05",
    "text": "在外的人，能做的也只剩再发一句『记得吃药』。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N05.wav",
    "duration_s": 4.992
  },
  "N06": {
    "id": "N06",
    "text": "可这件事，本来不该靠谁替她记着。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N06.wav",
    "duration_s": 4.008
  },
  "N07": {
    "id": "N07",
    "text": "她没打开什么 App，只是说了一句话。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N07.wav",
    "duration_s": 3.864
  },
  "N08": {
    "id": "N08",
    "text": "药到。不用学，只要说。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N08.wav",
    "duration_s": 3.648
  },
  "N09": {
    "id": "N09",
    "text": "这一段是设计示意，不是真机，也不是录屏。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N09.wav",
    "duration_s": 4.824
  },
  "N10": {
    "id": "N10",
    "text": "按设计，它一次只说一件事，说完等你，不打断。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N10.wav",
    "duration_s": 5.64
  },
  "N11": {
    "id": "N11",
    "text": "说定了，它把药名和时间复述一遍，问一句『您听听对不对』。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N11.wav",
    "duration_s": 6.096
  },
  "N12": {
    "id": "N12",
    "text": "建档，只要一句话；它会复述，不替您猜。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N12.wav",
    "duration_s": 4.968
  },
  "N13": {
    "id": "N13",
    "text": "问早上吃什么，它只念早饭那一段。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N13.wav",
    "duration_s": 3.912
  },
  "N14": {
    "id": "N14",
    "text": "一句『我吃过了』，就算记上；漏了也不责怪。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N14.wav",
    "duration_s": 4.68
  },
  "N15": {
    "id": "N15",
    "text": "问一句今天吃得怎么样，它算出还差几次，说得清清楚楚。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N15.wav",
    "duration_s": 6.312
  },
  "N16": {
    "id": "N16",
    "text": "正忙着？说一声『等会儿』，它就晚一点再来。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N16.wav",
    "duration_s": 4.92
  },
  "N17": {
    "id": "N17",
    "text": "下次唤醒它，到点还没打卡的那一次，它会先提一句。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N17.wav",
    "duration_s": 5.544
  },
  "N18": {
    "id": "N18",
    "text": "记不清名字，就把药盒举起来给它看。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N18.wav",
    "duration_s": 4.008
  },
  "N19": {
    "id": "N19",
    "text": "它念出认到的内容，认不清的，一次只问一件。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N19.wav",
    "duration_s": 4.968
  },
  "N20": {
    "id": "N20",
    "text": "一天还是那些事：早饭、午饭、晚饭。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N20.wav",
    "duration_s": 4.656
  },
  "N21": {
    "id": "N21",
    "text": "只是现在，她自己问得清，也自己答得上。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N21.wav",
    "duration_s": 4.68
  },
  "N22": {
    "id": "N22",
    "text": "电话再响的时候，那句『吃了』，终于不用猜。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N22.wav",
    "duration_s": 4.536
  },
  "N23": {
    "id": "N23",
    "text": "牵挂没变少，只是有了一个能被听见的地方。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N23.wav",
    "duration_s": 4.656
  },
  "N24": {
    "id": "N24",
    "text": "有些问题，它不接。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N24.wav",
    "duration_s": 2.64
  },
  "N25": {
    "id": "N25",
    "text": "不推荐药，不改剂量；不舒服就让您找家人、找大夫；紧急情况，先拨 120。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N25.wav",
    "duration_s": 8.976
  },
  "N26": {
    "id": "N26",
    "text": "它管的不是病，是那句总被忘掉的『记得』。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N26.wav",
    "duration_s": 4.224
  },
  "N27": {
    "id": "N27",
    "text": "老人不会用智能手机，但一定会说话。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N27.wav",
    "duration_s": 4.08
  },
  "N28": {
    "id": "N28",
    "text": "今天，给爸妈打个电话，问一句：今天吃药了吗。",
    "role": "narration",
    "kind": "narration",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
    "rate": "-9%",
    "pitch": "-3Hz",
    "wav": "tts/N28.wav",
    "duration_s": 5.232
  },
